{"id":"2004588162681427313","kind":"article","title":"死亡螺旋","author":"Rob Bensinger","original_authors":["Rob Bensinger"],"original_source_urls":["https://www.readthesequences.com/Death-Spirals-Sequence"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2026-02-10","updated":"2026-07-22","votes":15,"comment_count":3,"minutes":1,"chars":497,"keywords":["群体动力","理性主义社群","共同利益","群体思维","社会心理"],"summary":"Rob Bensinger 指出，围绕共同利益和理想凝聚的群体也可能产生有害机制；《死亡螺旋》系列讨论这些风险及其克服方式，页面随后列出相关文章和卷内位置。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2004588162681427313","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"m9lgenQ1\">在追求理性的过程中，我们会遇到许多有趣而深刻的新想法。通常，这也意味着结识志同道合的朋友，加入能激励自我提升的群体。但<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Death-Spirals-Sequence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《死亡螺旋》</a>系列指出，团结在共同利益和闪亮理念下的群体，也可能受到某些危害的影响。要从理性主义社区中获得最大收益，我们必须克服这些危害。</p><p data-pid=\"C64ECdeW\">——<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Rationality-An-Introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《理性：序言》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>by Rob Bensinger</p><hr/><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-95662db86354d22871110f330efa63d2.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"情感启发式\" data-tm-id=\"1948679023468213696\" href=\"#/post/1948679023468213696\">情感启发式</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-59315637f9ec97e747f93b98b1b2632e.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"可评估性（与假期购物省钱技巧）\" data-tm-id=\"1949761528619316687\" href=\"#/post/1949761528619316687\">可评估性（与假期购物省钱技巧）</a><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-9175bc30642c38f0cb904b1bc37f51bc.webp?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"无界标度、陪审团巨额裁决与未来预言\" data-tm-id=\"1951935719577739806\" href=\"#/post/1951935719577739806\">无界标度、陪审团巨额裁决与未来预言</a><a class=